---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="MySQL EXPLAIN & Query Optimization">
  <h1>MySQL EXPLAIN & Query Optimization</h1>
  <p>
    Your go-to guide for understanding why your queries are slow and how to fix them. Learn to read <code>EXPLAIN</code>, understand indexes, and optimize like a pro.
  </p>

  <div class="landing-grid">
    <div class="landing-card">
      <h3>EXPLAIN Basics</h3>
      <p>
        What does <code>EXPLAIN</code> actually tell you? We'll walk through each column and show you what to look for.
      </p>
      <p><a href="./explain">Read the guide →</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-card">
      <h3>Query Optimizer</h3>
      <p>
        Why does MySQL pick the queries it does? Learn the common mistakes that throw it off and how to steer it right.
      </p>
      <p><a href="./optimizer">Read the guide →</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-card">
      <h3>Indexes</h3>
      <p>
        Indexes are your secret weapon. We'll show you what they are, how to use them, and when they actually help.
      </p>
      <p><a href="./indexes">Read the guide →</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-card">
      <h3>Practice</h3>
      <p>
        Real examples with real problems. See a slow query, diagnose it, fix it, and watch it fly.
      </p>
      <p><a href="./practice">Work through it →</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
